Chiang's order of martial law worked. The Left faction under Wang Jingwei went completely silent.

He has repeatedly said that this was only targeted at specific individuals and hoped it wouldn't jeopardize cooperation with Russia and the CPC.

Now, Chiang Kai-shek has completely secured control over Guangzhou and the Guomindang. He has emerged as the true successor to Sun Yat-sen. The Northern Expedition gets ever closer as Chiang Kai-shek goes full speed ahead in preparation.
